DATA
----
All robot telemetry, fault events, maintenance records, operator notes and
fleet profiles in this project are SYNTHETIC. They are generated by the
project's own simulator from documented assumptions (configs/*.yaml). No
proprietary InGen telemetry, customer data or personal data is included.
"InGen Dynamics", "Aido Rover", "Fari", "Sentinel Prime AI", "Aido Humanoid"
and "Senpai" are used only to name the platforms being simulated; the
simulated parameters are not InGen specifications.

