- NASA C-MAPSS turbofan engine degradation data (FD001), A. Saxena and
  K. Goebel (2008), "Turbofan Engine Degradation Simulation Data Set",
  NASA Prognostics Data Repository, NASA Ames Research Center. Used only for
  the Week 2 external method check.

